  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P016-B013",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 16,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "142.4"
      ],
      "text": "142.4.            伤害 反映的是单位 接近被摧毁 的程度。\n                         想获取更多有关信息,请查阅规则 428.摧毁。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P016-B014",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 16,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "142.4.a"
      ],
      "text": "142.4.a.                 致命伤害 是指在清理期间会导致单位被摧毁的标记伤害 数值。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P016-B015",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 16,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "142.4.b"
      ],
      "text": "142.4.b.                 一名单位的致命伤害是指大于或等同于该单位战力的非零数值。\n                              举例:一名单位拥有 5[M],并已标记受到 3 点伤害。有玩家打出了“封冻”,并以该单位为目\n                               标。结算时,该单位的战力变为 3,因此会被标记致命伤害。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P016-B017",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 16,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "142.4.c"
      ],
      "text": "142.4.c.                 部分效果可能会改变该数值。这些效果会提及摧毁一名单位所需的伤害数值。\n                               举例:“远古巨龙”的被动技能的描述为:“你对敌方单位造成任意数量的伤害,都足以将其摧\n                               毁。”这个效果会改变被你标记伤害的敌方单位的致命伤害数值。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B002",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.1"
      ],
      "text": "315.1.              唤醒阶段",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B003",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.1.a"
      ],
      "text": "315.1.a.                   以下任务变为未决:",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B004",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.1.b"
      ],
      "text": "315.1.b.                   1.回合玩家将其控制的所有能变为活跃状态的游戏物体变为活跃状态。\n                                 想获取更多有关信息,请查阅规则 415.激活。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B005",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.2"
      ],
      "text": "315.2.              开始阶段",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B006",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.2.a"
      ],
      "text": "315.2.a.                   开始步骤",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B007",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.2.a.1"
      ],
      "text": "315.2.a.1.                        时机为“在开始阶段开始时”的游戏效果触发。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B008",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.2.b"
      ],
      "text": "315.2.b.                   得分计算步骤",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B009",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.2.b.1"
      ],
      "text": "315.2.b.1.                        以下任务变为未决:",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B010",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.2.b.2"
      ],
      "text": "315.2.b.2.                        1.回合玩家据守其控制的所有战场。\n                                      想获取更多有关信息,请查阅规则 467.得分计算。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B011",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.2.b.3"
      ],
      "text": "315.2.b.3.                        提示:在组队的游戏模式中,本步骤由回合玩家的队友所控制的战场,不计入回合玩家本回合\n                                  的得分。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B012",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.3"
      ],
      "text": "315.3.              召出阶段",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B013",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.3.a"
      ],
      "text": "315.3.a.                   以下任务变为未决:",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B014",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.3.b"
      ],
      "text": "315.3.b.                   1.回合玩家从符文牌堆中召出两张符文。\n                                 想获取更多有关信息,请查阅规则 430.召出。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B015",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.3.b.1"
      ],
      "text": "315.3.b.1.                        如果符文牌堆的符文少于两张,则有多少符文就召出多少。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B016",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.4"
      ],
      "text": "315.4.              抽牌阶段",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B017",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.4.a"
      ],
      "text": "315.4.a.                   以下任务变为未决:",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B018",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.4.b"
      ],
      "text": "315.4.b.                   1.回合玩家抽一张牌。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B019",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.4.b.1"
      ],
      "text": "315.4.b.1.                        如果回合玩家的主牌堆已经没有可供抽取的卡牌,则其视为该玩家已燃尽。\n                                      想获取更多有关信息,请查阅规则 431.燃尽。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P034-B020",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 34,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "315.4.b.2"
      ],
      "text": "315.4.b.2.                        完成燃尽后,回合玩家仍要抽一张牌。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B001",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.1"
      ],
      "text": "316.1.       完成回合开始的所有步骤后,便可以进入主阶段。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B002",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.2"
      ],
      "text": "316.2.       以下任务将按指定顺序变为未决:",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B003",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.3"
      ],
      "text": "316.3.       1.所有玩家的符文池全部清空,包括所有尚未消耗的法力和符能。\n                   想获取更多有关信息,请查阅规则 165.符文池。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B004",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.4"
      ],
      "text": "316.4.       2.时机为“在主阶段开始时”的游戏效果触发。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B005",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.5"
      ],
      "text": "316.5.       主阶段 没有限定的结构。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B006",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.5.a"
      ],
      "text": "316.5.a.            玩家在此阶段可进行任意数量的自决行动。\n                         想获取更多有关信息,请查阅规则 410.1.自决行动。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B007",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.5.b"
      ],
      "text": "316.5.b.            此阶段也被称为普通开环状态,只有回合玩家可以在此期间打出法术或激活技能。\n                         想获取更多有关信息,请查阅规则 307.回合状态。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B008",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.5.b.1"
      ],
      "text": "316.5.b.1.               在组队的游戏模式中,回合玩家的队友可以在此期间打出法术或激活技能(包括不具有[迅捷]\n                         和[反应]的法术和技能)。只有在回合玩家使用自己的优先行动权发起邀请时,其他玩家才能\n                         执行此操作。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B009",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.6"
      ],
      "text": "316.6.       玩家进行自决行动后,可能会出现一个或多个结构化阶段。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B010",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.7"
      ],
      "text": "316.7.       战斗",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B011",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.7.a"
      ],
      "text": "316.7.a.            如果敌对玩家控制的单位出现在同一处战场,则引发战斗。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B012",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.7.b"
      ],
      "text": "316.7.b.            标准移动 固有技能、法术 或其他游戏效果 都可能引发战斗。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B013",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.7.c"
      ],
      "text": "316.7.c.            战斗启动后,作为起源的游戏效果不会改变战斗的结构或流程。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B014",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.7.d"
      ],
      "text": "316.7.d.            战斗 只能在两名玩家之间发生。\n                         想获取更多有关信息,请查阅规则 459.战斗。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B015",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.7.e"
      ],
      "text": "316.7.e.            游戏按照战斗步骤继续进行。\n                         想获取更多有关信息,请查阅规则 463.战斗步骤。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B016",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.7.f"
      ],
      "text": "316.7.f.            战斗也包含了法术对决。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B017",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.8"
      ],
      "text": "316.8.       法术对决",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B018",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.8.a"
      ],
      "text": "316.8.a.            发生战斗时,即会发生法术对决。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B019",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.8.a.1"
      ],
      "text": "316.8.a.1.               由战斗触发的法术对决,将视为战斗的下属阶段。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B020",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.8.b"
      ],
      "text": "316.8.b.            战场 上的法术对决 ,会在该战场 进入争夺 状态后的清理步骤中标记为待发生 。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P035-B021",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 35,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.8.b.1"
      ],
      "text": "316.8.b.1.               玩家将单位移动至空战场触发的法术对决视为一个独立阶段,不会引发战斗。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P036-B001",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 36,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.8.b.1.a"
      ],
      "text": "316.8.b.1.a.                         此类法术对决称为非战斗法术对决 。在非战斗法术对决 进行期间,其他玩家控制的单\n                                     位可能会出现在正在进行法术对决的战场上,从而使该法术对决在后续清理步骤变为\n                                     战斗法术对决 。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P036-B002",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 36,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.8.c"
      ],
      "text": "316.8.c.                   法术对决 是一个结构化的机会窗口 ,玩家 在此期间可以打出卡牌、或激活带有[迅捷 ]或[反应 ]的技能。\n                                想获取更多有关信息,请查阅规则 341.法术对决。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P036-B003",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 36,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.9"
      ],
      "text": "316.9.              玩家没有想要执行的自决行动时,就必须表明自己将结束本回合。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
      "id": "DOC-04-P036-B004",
      "document": "DOC-04",
      "page": 36,
      "clauseAnchors": [
        "316.9.a"
      ],
      "text": "316.9.a.                   主阶段 将随之结束。",
      "reviewStatus": "NOT_REVIEWED",
      "implementation": [],
      "tests": []
    },
    {
